<view class="page-shell"><view class="surface card"><text>动物观察 · {{campusName || '未选择高校'}}</text><view>选择真实图片，AI 结果需人工检查；不会自动建立动物身份。</view><button bindtap="choose" disabled="{{busy}}">选择图片</button><view>{{imagePath ? '已选择图片' : '未选择图片'}}</view><textarea placeholder="观察描述" value="{{text}}" bindinput="textChanged" /><input placeholder="观察地点（可选）" value="{{location}}" bindinput="locationChanged" /><button bindtap="parse" disabled="{{busy}}">AI 解析</button><button bindtap="manual" disabled="{{busy}}">手工录入</button><view wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{message}}">{{message}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{draft}}" class="surface card"><view>任务状态：{{task.status}}</view><picker range="{{speciesOptions}}" value="{{speciesIndex}}" bindchange="speciesChanged"><view>物种：{{draft.species}}</view></picker><picker range="{{sexOptions}}" value="{{sexIndex}}" bindchange="sexChanged"><view>性别：{{draft.sex}}</view></picker><input value="{{draft.coatColor}}" bindinput="colorChanged" placeholder="毛色" /><textarea value="{{draft.behavior}}" bindinput="behaviorChanged" placeholder="行为" /><textarea value="{{draft.visibleCondition}}" bindinput="conditionChanged" placeholder="可见状态" /><view>其他结构化字段（可编辑）</view><textarea value="{{draftJson}}" bindinput="jsonChanged" maxlength="-1" /><button bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新任务状态</button><button wx:if="{{!task.confirmedAt}}" bindtap="confirm" disabled="{{busy}}">确认观察草稿</button></view><view wx:if="{{task.confirmedAt}}" class="surface card"><button wx:if="{{!matching && !decisionLocked}}" bindtap="findMatches" disabled="{{busy}}">查找可能是同一只的动物</button><view wx:if="{{matching}}">匹配分数仅供参考，请人工核对。<view wx:if="{{matching.matchingMode === 'MANUAL_FALLBACK'}}">自动匹配不可用，当前为手工处理。</view><view wx:elif="{{matching.lowConfidence}}">候选置信度较低，请谨慎选择。</view><view wx:if="{{matching.candidates.length === 0}}">没有可用候选。</view><view wx:for="{{matching.candidates}}" wx:key="animalId"><view>{{item.displayName}} · {{item.species}} · {{item.scoreText}}</view><view>{{item.reasonText}}</view><button wx:if="{{!decisionLocked}}" data-kind="SELECT_EXISTING" data-id="{{item.animalId}}" bindtap="chooseDecision" disabled="{{busy}}">选择这只并发布</button></view><textarea wx:if="{{!decisionLocked}}" value="{{postText}}" bindinput="postChanged" placeholder="动态内容（暂不确定时无需填写）" /><button wx:if="{{!decisionLocked}}" data-kind="NO_MATCH" bindtap="chooseDecision" disabled="{{busy}}">没有匹配对象</button><button wx:if="{{!decisionLocked}}" data-kind="UNSURE" bindtap="chooseDecision" disabled="{{busy}}">暂不确定</button></view><view wx:if="{{decisionLocked && !finalization}}"><view>决定结果尚未确定，请先查询状态。</view><button bindtap="checkDecision" disabled="{{busy}}">查询决定状态</button><button wx:if="{{statusChecked && pending}}" bindtap="retryDecision" disabled="{{busy}}">继续原决定</button></view><view wx:if="{{finalization}}">决定：{{finalization.decision.decisionType}}<view wx:if="{{finalization.createdPost}}">动态已发布：{{finalization.createdPost.id}}<button bindtap="openPost">查看动态</button></view><view wx:if="{{finalization.proposalId}}">已创建建档提案：{{finalization.proposalId}}（不代表已创建动物身份）</view><view wx:if="{{finalization.decision.decisionType === 'UNSURE'}}">未创建动态或建档提案。</view></view></view></view>